"{\n  \"reasoning\": \"INFEASIBLE: The 100\u202f\u00b5W power budget limits Itail to \u224815\u202f\u00b5A (P = 3.3\u202fV\u00b72\u00b7Itail). Even at the highest practical gm/Id of 24, this yields gm1 \u2248 24\u00b77.5\u202f\u00b5A \u2248 180\u202f\u00b5S, giving GBW \u2248 gm1/(2\u03c0\u00b7CL) \u2248 5.7\u202fMHz, far below the required 100\u202fMHz. Hence the specifications cannot be satisfied with this OTA topology under the power limit, though the following device choices stay within the allowed width range.\",\n  \"gmid1\": 24,\n  \"L1_um\": 2,\n  \"gmid3\": 24,\n  \"L3_um\": 2,\n  \"gmid5\": 24,\n  \"L5_um\": 2,\n  \"Itail_uA\": 15\n}"